Pictures of the game systems for Daijishou (wallpaper and thumbnail of each platform).

They are the COLORFUL platform pack, the one Daijishou itself uses when a platform is
added by hand:
  pictures: viking, "Colorful resources" on the LaunchBox forums
            (https://forums.launchbox-app.com/files/file/2485-colorful-resources/)
  edited:   iShade (UsagiShade)
  indexed:  TapiocaFox (Yves Chen) for Daijishou,
            github.com/TapiocaFox/Daijishou themes/platform_wallpapers_packs/colorful
            at commit cde33bb64af2eb1cc56965c8a68702b3485a6d73 (index.json here)

Only the pictures our platforms use, shrunk to at most 854x480 as JPEG by
emulators/scripts/fetch-daijishou-art.py; the console names them like Daijishou does
(files/platform_wallpapers/<id>.png). The game system names and looks shown belong to
their owners.
